  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;be a point on the parabola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></math>.&nbsp;If the distance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;from the center of the circle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is minimum, then the equation of the tangent to the parabola at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Equation normal at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></math> be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>It passes a normal through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So, point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Equation of a tangent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math>at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.</p>"
